<title>USA: St. Charles, Ill. won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</title>
<headline>St. Charles, Ill. won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank, Chicago said it won $5 million of St. Charles, Ill., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.8652 percent.</p>
